      "seed": 1523323551,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2033291071,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563141220,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Without ARP proxying, Container-1's broadcast ARP stops at the L3 boundary between hosts: nobody answers and the failure is silent.\nl2miss / l3miss ask the kernel to report lookups it could not answer, so the driver can react.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b20",
      "originalText": "Without ARP proxying, Container-1's broadcast ARP stops at the L3 boundary between hosts: nobody answers and the failure is silent.\nl2miss / l3miss ask the kernel to report lookups it could not answer, so the driver can react.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
